    "name": "Mike Mangini",
    "role": "Drums",
    "tenure": "2011–2023",
    "bio": {
      "overview": "Mike Mangini is an American drummer known for his work with Dream Theater from 2011 to 2023, bringing technical precision and dynamic energy to the band's recordings and live performances.",
      "extended_bio": [
        "Former Berklee College of Music faculty member who held five World's Fastest Drummer titles",
        "Joined Dream Theater in 2011 after an extensive audition process documented in the 'The Spirit Carries On' film",
        "Contributed to albums from A Dramatic Turn of Events (2011) to A View from the Top of the World (2021)"
      ]
    },
